[0m[0m
Raw bytes throughout ([38;5;10m&[u8][0m, not [38;5;10mstr[0m) so embedded NULs truncate via [38;5;10mstrlen[0m exactly as in C, and non-UTF-8 input doesn't diverge.[0m[0m
