- [38;5;10mvalidate_sequence[0m aliases the [38;5;10mchar *[0m input as [38;5;10mbool *[0m and overwrites the caller's buffer in place. Each byte is read before it is written and the buffer is dead afterward, so I used a separate [38;5;10mVec<bool>[0m; this is observationally identical and noted in a comment.[0m[0m
